<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Feb unemployment rate unchanged at 5.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Swiss Feb unemployment rate unchanged at 5.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's unemployment rate stood at 5.7 in February, unchanged from January, the Federal Office of Trade, Industry and Labour said.</p>
<p>					 Feb 1997  Jan 1997  Feb 1996</p>
<p> Pct of workforce unemployed     5.7	 5.7	 4.6</p>
<p> Number of jobless		 206,291   205,501   166,102</p>
<p> Job vacancies			 7,508    5,794	5,369</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
